OL,3,GNEWSADelivery date for food waste
OL,4,Acontainers confirmed
OL,5,
OL,6,FDelivery of food waste caddies will get
OL,7,Funder way for most households in part
OL,8,Fof Leicestershire from next week.
OL,10,FCharnwood Borough Council announced
OL,11,Fearlier this month it would begin to
OL,12,Froll out a weekly food waste recycling
OL,13,Fservice for more than 70,000 homes from
OL,14,F2 November.
OL,16,FNow, it has confirmed deliveries of two
OL,17,Fcaddies, liners and an information
OL,18,Fleaflet for each household will be
OL,19,Fstaggered over a four-week period
OL,20,Fbetween 28 September and 23 October.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
