OL,3,GNEWSADelivery date for food waste
OL,4,Acontainers confirmed
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this year, an investigation
OL,7,Ffound one in four councils would miss
OL,8,Fthe March deadline for setting up their
OL,9,Ffood waste collection and in July,
OL,10,FHarborough District Council was facing
OL,11,Fa six-month delay due to equipment
OL,12,Fproblems.
